{"product_id":"smok-propod-22w-pod-kit","title":"SMOK Propod 22W Pod Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003eShop the SMOK Propod 22W \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/vape-kenya\" title=\"Pod vape\"\u003ePod Vape\u003c\/a\u003e Kit, featuring an integrated 800mAh battery, 22W maximum output, and is paired natively with the exemplary NOVO 2X Pods. Formerly the SMOK Prisma.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility:\u003cbr\u003eNovo Pods\u003cbr\u003eNovo 2 Pods\u003cbr\u003eNovo 2X Pods\u003cbr\u003eNovo 3 Pods\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConstructed from durable zinc-alloy, the chassis of the Propod Pod Kit is impervious to light falls and drops, protecting the 800mAh battery within. Operating off a draw and button-activated firing mechanism, the Propod is great for those that are on-the-go or traveling. In addition, the top fill nature of the Novo 2X pods prevent leaking, with the Propod Pod Kit accepting Novo and Novo 2 Pods as well.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSMOK Propod 22W Pod Kit Features:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 107mm by 24.5mm by 15mm\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Capacity: 800mAh\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMax Wattage Output: 22W\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMax Voltage Output: 3.6V\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: 0.6-2.5ohm\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChassis Material: Zinc-Alloy\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging: Type-C Port\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOperation: Button \u0026amp; Draw-Activated\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Series: Novo 2X\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFill System: Top Fill\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Material: PCTG\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: 2mL\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Connection: Magnetic\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCoil Support: Novo \u0026amp; Novo 2 Pod Compatbility\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Propod Device\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 0.8ohm Novo 2X Pods\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Type-C Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42058547658807,"sku":"Smok Propod Pod Kit","price":4500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smok_propod_22w_pod_kit_-_black.webp?v=1768250705","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-propod-22w-pod-kit","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




